  "description": "Microsoft Entra External ID (formerly Azure AD B2C) adapter for VisuAuth: implements IUserStore, IRoleStore, and IAuthenticationFlow against the Microsoft Graph API using app-only (client credentials) auth. Targets customer-facing tenants where end users sign in with an email + password local account managed by Microsoft. Declares SupportsLocalLogin = false so VisuAuth's end-user UI surfaces the hosted Microsoft login while the admin UI manages users / roles directly against Graph.",
